# Mac is the source of truth

When iPhone and Mac show the same thing, follow the Mac app. Do not invent a
parallel layout, label, or grouping for iOS.

- Use the Mac name, section order, and open or collapsed state.
- If Mac has no equivalent, ask before adding one.
- A combined iPhone count that mixes Mac sections is wrong. Count the same set Mac shows in that place.
